  "description": "Victorian Whimsy Pink Christmas Patterns – 100 Seamless Digital Paper Bundle\nAdd soft holiday elegance, vintage charm, and sweet pastel nostalgia to your creative projects with this massive collection of 100 seamless pink Victorian Christmas digital papers. Beautifully designed with delicate vintage holiday elements including antique sleighs, evergreen pine bows, gingerbread houses, holiday gnomes, bunnies in cozy winter scarves, dried orange slices, holiday puddings, cozy stockings, hedgies, and ornate vintage bauble ornaments.\nEvery single pattern repeats seamlessly and is rendered in high resolution, making them perfect for fabric printing, holiday wrapping paper, scrapbooking, sublimation, home decor, and countless seasonal craft creations.\nWhat is Included in Your Download:\n* 100 Seamless Digital Papers (Delivered in organized ZIP archives)\n* Format: High-Quality JPG format\n* Size: 3072 x 3072 px High-Resolution digital paper sheets (300 DPI)\nPerfect For:\n* Print-on-Demand (POD): Festive apparel, holiday blankets, tote bags, pillows, and mugs\n* Stationery & Paper Crafts: Christmas gift wrapping paper, scrapbook layouts, junk journals, planner stickers, and holiday gift tags\n* Seasonal Decor: Christmas greeting cards, holiday party invitations, table runners, and banners\n* Fabric & Textiles: Winter quilting, festive kitchen towels, bandanas, and baby clothes\n* Sublimation & DIY Crafts: Tumbler wraps, glass beer cans, phone cases, and holiday ornaments\nCompatible Software:\nPhotoshop, Illustrator, Canva, Procreate, Affinity Designer, CorelDRAW, Inkscape, or any software supporting standard JPG files.\nImportant Notes:\n* This is a digital download product; no physical items will be shipped.\n* Files come compressed in standard ZIP folders. Please extract/unzip after downloading to access the individual patterns.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Victorian Whimsy Pink Christmas Patterns – 100 Seamless Digital Paper Bundle</p>\n<p>Add soft holiday elegance, vintage charm, and sweet pastel nostalgia to your creative projects with this massive collection of 100 seamless pink Victorian Christmas digital papers. Beautifully designed with delicate vintage holiday elements including antique sleighs, evergreen pine bows, gingerbread houses, holiday gnomes, bunnies in cozy winter scarves, dried orange slices, holiday puddings, cozy stockings, hedgies, and ornate vintage bauble ornaments.</p>\n<p>Every single pattern repeats seamlessly and is rendered in high resolution, making them perfect for fabric printing, holiday wrapping paper, scrapbooking, sublimation, home decor, and countless seasonal craft creations.</p>\n<p>What is Included in Your Download:</p>\n<p>* 100 Seamless Digital Papers (Delivered in organized ZIP archives)<br>\n* Format: High-Quality JPG format<br>\n* Size: 3072 x 3072 px High-Resolution digital paper sheets (300 DPI)</p>\n<p>Perfect For:</p>\n<p>* Print-on-Demand (POD): Festive apparel, holiday blankets, tote bags, pillows, and mugs<br>\n* Stationery &amp; Paper Crafts: Christmas gift wrapping paper, scrapbook layouts, junk journals, planner stickers, and holiday gift tags<br>\n* Seasonal Decor: Christmas greeting cards, holiday party invitations, table runners, and banners<br>\n* Fabric &amp; Textiles: Winter quilting, festive kitchen towels, bandanas, and baby clothes<br>\n* Sublimation &amp; DIY Crafts: Tumbler wraps, glass beer cans, phone cases, and holiday ornaments</p>\n<p>Compatible Software:<br>\nPhotoshop, Illustrator, Canva, Procreate, Affinity Designer, CorelDRAW, Inkscape, or any software supporting standard JPG files.</p>\n<p>Important Notes:</p>\n<p>* This is a digital download product; no physical items will be shipped.<br>\n* Files come compressed in standard ZIP folders. Please extract/unzip after downloading to access the individual patterns.</p>",
